  <description>
    <p>
      Yadaw is a minimal rust-based digital audio workstation built to not crash as much as the alternatives. It mainly depends on external plugins,
      and has no inbuilt plugins of its own to keep the base light.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Multi-track audio recording and editing</li>
      <li>MIDI input with piano roll editor</li>
      <li>CLAP and LV2 plugin hosting</li>
      <li>Automation lanes</li>
      <li>WAV import/export</li>
      <li>Cross-platform support</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      No VST support (LV2/CLAP only). No built-in plugins.
      No MP3/FLAC export (WAV only).
    </p>
  </description>
